      "text": {
        "jp": "大きいチョコボはいっぱい食べて\r\nその分強くなれるってことだな！",
        "official_en": "A big chocobo means a big appetite, which means a stronger chocobo!",
        "real_en": "Bigger chocobos can eat more, which means they can grow stronger!"
